{"id":"n14971-1-7","stage":2,"title":"두리번거리다 · 东张西望","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14971-1-7-1","ko":"왜 그렇게 주위를 두리번거려?","zh":"为什么到处张望呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주위를","meaning":"周围","explanation":"주위：周围；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"주위","audio":"/audio/9776611139b2a008d05e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66583","senseId":"1","lemma":"주위","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"두리번거려?","meaning":"东张西望，左顾右盼","explanation":"두리번거리다：东张西望，左顾右盼；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"두리번거리다","audio":"/audio/d7e5f45f1dfcce33b567.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14971","senseId":"1","lemma":"두리번거리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"9776611139b2a008","term":"주위","zh":"周围","audio":"/audio/9776611139b2a008d05e.mp3","entryId":"66583","definition":"围住某地的周边。","pronunciation":["주위"]},{"id":"d7e5f45f1dfcce33","term":"두리번거리다","zh":"东张西望，左顾右盼","audio":"/audio/d7e5f45f1dfcce33b567.mp3","entryId":"14971","definition":"睁大眼睛总是到处观察。","pronunciation":["두리번거리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ff2e30b805e10ffcc6e1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14971-1-7-2","ko":"이 파티에 아는 사람이 누가 왔나 해서.","zh":"我在想这个派对上有没有我认识的人来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"파티에","meaning":"聚会，派对","explanation":"파티：聚会，派对；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"파티","audio":"/audio/8b4516ad32541125112c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26907","senseId":"1","lemma":"파티","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아는","meaning":"认识，相识","explanation":"알다：认识，相识；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"10","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람이","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"누가","meaning":"谁","explanation":"누구：谁；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"1","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왔나","meaning":"来，来参加","explanation":"오다：来，来参加；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"12","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해서.","meaning":"因为，由于","explanation":"하다：因为，由于；어서：在句末省略后文，补充原因或背景。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"18","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"8b4516ad32541125","term":"파티","zh":"聚会，派对","audio":"/audio/8b4516ad32541125112c.mp3","entryId":"26907","definition":"为增进友谊或纪念什么事情而举行的宴会或集会。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"认识，相识","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"以前见过，或有过交流而亲密往来。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"可以思考，会制造并使用语言和工具、构成社会而生活的存在。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"e9e6266b8035d7c4","term":"누구","zh":"谁","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3","entryId":"62078","definition":"指不认识的人。","pronunciation":["누구"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来参加","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了参与某个有目的性的聚会而从另一个地方转移到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"因为，由于","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示原因。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/efdf4e59527d0b1510ba.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.127,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14971","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":69,"sequenceScore":1.8523,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我在想这个派对上有没有我认识的人来。","你和智秀吵架了吗？","为什么到处张望呢？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我在想这个派对上有没有我认识的人来。","为什么到处张望呢？","你和智秀吵架了吗？"],"answer":0}]}
